---
/* The pipeline's full-scale run as a receipt: where every line went, and the run time before and after. Figures from the README. */
import Mark from '../Mark.astro';

const lines = [
  { label: 'loaded', value: '18,710,000' },
  { label: 'invalid', value: '111,408' },
  { label: 'duplicates', value: '21,826' },
  { label: 'orphaned', value: '53,793' },
];
---

<figure class="ledger">
  <div class="receipt">
    <p class="head">reconciliation<span>full run · generated data</span></p>

    <dl>
      <div class="row big"><dt>lines read</dt><dd>18,897,027</dd></div>
      {lines.map((l) => <div class="row"><dt>{l.label}</dt><dd>{l.value}</dd></div>)}
      <div class="row sum">
        <dt>accounted for</dt>
        <dd><Mark kind="circle">18,897,027</Mark></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <dl class="after">
      <div class="row">
        <dt>full run</dt>
        <dd><Mark kind="strike">584 s</Mark> <b>345 s</b></dd>
      </div>
      <div class="row"><dt>merge step</dt><dd><Mark kind="strike" delay={200}>267 s</Mark> <b>102 s</b></dd></div>
      <div class="row"><dt>quality checks</dt><dd>13 / 13</dd></div>
    </dl>

    <p class="foot">every line lands in exactly one bucket</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    From the full-scale benchmark: 5.9 GB of generated NDJSON with injected defects, on one machine. Counts matched the generator’s manifest.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ledger {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .receipt {
    max-width: 24rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: rotate(1deg);
    transition: transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);
    /* A torn bottom edge. */
    -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#000 0 0) top / 100% calc(100% - 10px) no-repeat, conic-gradient(from -45deg at bottom, #0000, #000 1deg 89deg, #0000 90deg) bottom / 16px 10px repeat-x;
    mask: linear-gradient(#000 0 0) top / 100% calc(100% - 10px) no-repeat, conic-gradient(from -45deg at bottom, #0000, #000 1deg 89deg, #0000 90deg) bottom / 16px 10px repeat-x;
  }

  .ledger:hover .receipt {
    transform: rotate(0deg);
  }

  .head {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-rule-strong);
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .head span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .row dt::after {
    content: '';
  }

  .row dt {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .row dt::after {
    flex: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--color-rule-strong);
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .row:not(.big):not(.sum) dt {
    padding-left: var(--space-3);
  }

  .big dt,
  .sum dt {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .sum {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-rule-strong);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .after {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-rule-strong);
  }

  .after dt {
    padding-left: 0 !important;
  }

  .after b {
    margin-left: var(--space-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--pen-ink);
  }

  .after .mk {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .foot {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .receipt,
    .ledger:hover .receipt {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
